OL,3,ASurgeon having lunch near Krakow
OL,4,Ashooting undoubtedly saved officer's
OL,5,Alife, colleague says
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the two surgeons who rushed to
OL,8,Fsave lives in the aftermath of a mass
OL,9,Fshooting in Poland says his colleague
OL,10,Fstopped the bleeding of the police
OL,11,Fofficer, "undoubtedly" saving his life.
OL,13,FProfessor Michal PDYdziwiatr and Dr
OL,14,FMateusz Wierdak were having lunch in
OL,15,Fcentral Krakow with their families when
OL,16,Fthey heard gunshots, local media
OL,17,Freports.
OL,19,F"Suddenly my son ran up and said: 'Dad,
OL,20,Fthey're shooting at people there,
OL,21,Fpeople are falling to the ground',"
OL,22,FPDYdziwiatr told news outlet Fakt.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
